  "worked_solution": "We substitute $x=4$ into the function definition and then simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & ={x}^{2}-{4}^{x-2} \\\\ f(4) & ={4}^{2}-{4}^{4-2} \\\\  & =16-{4}^{2} \\\\  & =16-16 \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$",
